WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:00.834 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-This is amazing.

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:03.636
I did not -- and I know you, and
I did not know this about you.

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:06.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
The Congressman Seth Moulton
is coming out next.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:07.040 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-He's the Congressman

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.109 size:84% position:42%
in Massachusetts' Sixth
Congressional District,

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
I believe.
-The Sixth Congressional

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:12.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
District, yes.
-And we were texting because

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:13.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
you said,
"I can't believe he's on."

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:16.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
because your great-grandfather
was the Congressman

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
in that district.
-Yes, and my great-uncle

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
after him.
-This is the Bates'.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.257
And these are photos of your --
-That's my great-grandfather,

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:28.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
so my grandmother's --
my nana's dad.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:29.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-George Bates.

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:32.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's her brother,
William A.K.A. Bill Bates.

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:35.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so they served --
and I'm sorry if I'm going to

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:38.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
get it wrong --
from I think the mid' 40s

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:41.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
until 1967.
-That's crazy.

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:42.142 size:88% position:44% line:92%
So, a crazy coincidence.

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:44.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
But then you reached out
to your nana today.

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:46.746 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yes.
-I'm a big fan of your nana.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yes, you have
a marblehead connection.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:51.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, your nana and my mother
are from the same town

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:51.985 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
in Massachusetts.

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:53.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, we've been
through this before.

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:55.588
But they were in the same
charity musical review.

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:58.224 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, so there's
a lot of coincidences.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:00:58.658 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:00.727 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But you --
You reached out to your nana

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:03.163
to see if there's anything
you wanted me to address

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:04.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the Congressman
when he comes out next.

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, she had a few things.
-Okay, great.

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Let me see.
What did she tell me

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:09.235 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
to tell you?

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:12.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Be careful with
his license plate."

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:15.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
Her dad had a special
license plate that everyone

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the town
of Salem, Massachusetts --

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:19.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yes, that one...
-Uh-huh.

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:21.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...knew because
he was the Congressman.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:24.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she once went to get pizza
when it was new.

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:27.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is a long time ago.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:31.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
Pizza was new to Boston area,
and you could only get it

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:33.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
at a bar.
So she wanted to try pizza.

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:35.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
So she parked the car --
the Congressman's car

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:38.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
outside of a bar,
and it was a real scandal.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:40.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow.
-Yeah, back then that's

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:41.634 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
what a scandal was.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.703 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:47.540 line:92%
A young woman wanted pizza.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she also --
She said, "Well,

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:53.213
I know he just got married.
But Seth doesn't need to

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:55.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
bring that up,
because he knows that."

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:55.582 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:57.917 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you don't need to tell him
that he's married.

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:58.351 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:03.890
-She said, "He should know that
his district was the first to be

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.592 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Gary-mandered."

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:06.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said --
Yeah, I know.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
I'm with all of you.

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:10.196 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:15.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "Gerry --"
"No, Gary-mandered is how

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:19.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
it should be pronounced.
Eldridge Gary was --"

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:22.041 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm telling you,
but I'm also just quoting her

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.977 align:start size:94% position:6%
the whole time,
so please don't think I'm just

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:25.278 size:88% position:44% line:92%
telling you this fact --

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:28.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
"He was the first Governor
of Massachusetts,

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:30.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he was Vice President
under James Madison.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.821
And I hear that James Madison's
wife did not like him."

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:36.022 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:38.892 line:92%
So that's town gossip still.

00:02:38.892 --> 00:02:41.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
And someone saw that the
districts had been carved into

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:44.831
a strange way and they said,
"That looks like a salamander."

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:47.567
And someone else said,
"No, it's a Gary-mander."

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:49.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because Eldridge Gary
had done it.

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:51.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-I said, "You know, everyone,

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:54.507 size:75% position:38%
and I mean everyone,
says gerrymander."

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.843 line:92%
She said, "Everyone is wrong."

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:57.377 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:59.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, once again --
-Once again --

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:03.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your nana --
-Nana a million, you zero.

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:04.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
Nana brings the facts.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.485 size:81% position:41%
-She also then said --
I was talking to her

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:08.254
on the phone today about it, you
know, just getting the details.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:10.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
She goes, "When are
you rehearsing this?"

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:12.192 line:92%
I said, "Well, it is 4:00 now.

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:13.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'll be there
in a few hours,

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:15.929 size:75% position:38%
so we're never going
to rehearse this."

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:18.198
She goes, "you just go
on television with this?"

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:19.832 size:75% position:38%
I said, "Yeah, yeah.
You okay with that?"

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:21.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
She goes, "Oh,
I'm fine with it."

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:23.336 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.336 --> 00:03:25.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
And yes,
she was very, very excited.

00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:28.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I'm very excited
to ask him all about this.

00:03:28.575 --> 00:03:30.076 line:92%
-Now -- Sorry, real quick.

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:35.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
Her brother and father were
Republican Congressmen.

00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:36.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-This seat has gone back

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:37.917 align:start size:94% position:6%
and forth,
Republican and Democrat.

00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:42.055
My grandmother with Republican
family, has grown up Republican.

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:45.992
I'm making far more efforts
to explain it to all of you

00:03:45.992 --> 00:03:46.993 size:75% position:38% line:92%
than she ever would.

00:03:46.993 --> 00:03:48.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
She would go,
"I'm a Republican."

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:50.163 line:92%
And that would be the end of it.

00:03:50.163 --> 00:03:53.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, she said,
"I like him so much.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wish he'd come
over to our side,

00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:57.870 line:92%
and I'm here to welcome him."

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.005 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:01.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
But then she said,
"You know, I asked my father

00:04:01.174 --> 00:04:03.176 size:88% position:44%
once, 'cause all of the
other Irish Catholics --

00:04:03.176 --> 00:04:05.278
the Kennedy's, everyone --
they were all Democrats.

00:04:05.278 --> 00:04:06.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said,
'Why aren't we Democrats?

00:04:06.879 --> 00:04:08.514 line:92%
They seem to have more fun.'

00:04:08.514 --> 00:04:11.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said,
'They do have more fun.

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:14.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
But legislation is not
about having fun.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.989 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It's serious business.'"

00:04:15.989 --> 00:04:16.856 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:18.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Truer words.
-That was the end of the call.

00:04:18.891 --> 00:04:19.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Very good.

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:20.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's always a pleasure.
-My pleasure.

00:04:23.129 --> 00:04:24.097 line:92%
-Can't wait for your shows.

00:04:24.097 --> 00:04:26.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
Can't wait for
the Film Spirit Awards.

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:27.800 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
John Mulaney.

